{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1338177-psions-psiads-with-mega-edges","id":1338177,"title":"Psions/Psiads with Mega-Edges","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-09-27T13:53:57-07:00","id":1338177,"title":"Psions/Psiads with Mega-Edges","content":"So as the title says what do you all think of the completely fan made idea of adding Mega-Edges (of course with some changes) to the Psion/Psiad template. I mean I know that technically its not super necessary but as Mega-Edges (and Mega-Attributes are really cool) I think it would be a nifty addition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-27T14:34:41-07:00","id":1338183,"title":"","content":"As I understand them, the difference between Quantum Powers and Mega-Edges is that the former are active manipulations of Quantum energy while the latter are modifications to the Nova's already existing abilities \u2014 often, but not always, enhancements to what their Mega-Attributes can do. <br /> <br /> Mega-Attributes are cool. They're also a defining feature of Novas, and I'm not in the least bit interested in putting them over to psis. So <i>if</i> psis end up with an equivalent to Mega-Edges, they should only get ones that represent modifications to normal human capabilities. For what it's worth, they already have Psionic Edges that modify their psionic powers (e.g., Detached, Enhanced Attunement, and Favored Mode). <br /> <br /> That said, I'd also want to present the psionic equivalent of Mega-Edges as consequences of the existing Aptitudes. This would take the form of having Aptitudes as perquisites. Body Modification, for example, might be something that a psi can take; but it would have a prerequisite of Chimera (that is, Transmogrify \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022): you have to be an advanced biokinetic to develop Body Modifications, which would basically be permanent Transmogrifications. <br /> <br /> But with appropriate Mode prerequisites, I see nothing wrong with psychic \u201cMega-Edges\u201d.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-27T14:50:55-07:00","id":1338186,"title":"","content":"What you say is interesting, though I do want to mention that if I was to add Mega-Edges to Psion/Psiads it would be in a variant game where Novas either don't exist or aren't anywhere near playable. So in this version Mega-Edges just naturally exist for Psi users. Its for that reason I labeled this as a fan thought and not even remotely something I would want as part of a standard game. <br /> <br /> (Honestly, I have to say when it comes to Novas I enjoy Mega-Attributes and Mega-Edges more then I do Quantum Powers, lol). <br /> <br /> But yeah, your idea for allowing certain high level Mode effects to branch off into Psions gaining Psionic Edges as a very interesting idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-27T14:56:13-07:00","id":1338188,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1338177-psions-psiads-with-mega-edges#post1338177\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So as the title says what do you all think of the completely fan made idea of adding Mega-Edges (of course with some changes) to the Psion/Psiad template. I mean I know that technically its not super necessary but as Mega-Edges (and Mega-Attributes are really cool) I think it would be a nifty addition.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why? What does doing so thematically add to the game?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-27T15:01:31-07:00","id":1338191,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1338177-psions-psiads-with-mega-edges?p=1338188#post1338188\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Why? What does doing so thematically add to the game?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nothing. I would just like to have a character who has Mega-Edges with Psychic Powers rather then the haphazard Quantum Power. <br /> <br /> So I guess in answer to why, well, it might be fun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-27T15:13:21-07:00","id":1338198,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1338177-psions-psiads-with-mega-edges?p=1338186#post1338186\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What you say is interesting, though I do want to mention that if I was to add Mega-Edges to Psion/Psiads it would be in a variant game where Novas either don't exist or aren't anywhere near playable. So in this version Mega-Edges just naturally exist for Psi users. Its for that reason I labeled this as a fan thought and not even remotely something I would want as part of a standard game. <br /> <br /> (Honestly, I have to say when it comes to Novas I enjoy Mega-Attributes and Mega-Edges more then I do Quantum Powers, lol). <br /> <br /> But yeah, your idea for allowing certain high level Mode effects to branch off into Psions gaining Psionic Edges as a very interesting idea.</div> </div> </div> </div>In that case, I'd still put the Aptitudes front and center by requiring thematically suitable ones (or rather, thematically suitable Modes) as prerequisites for any Mega-Attributes or Mega-Edges they might obtain. They should still be outgrowths of the psionic powers, which are at the core of being a psi.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}